    ("#023//Jamukha", "%3Altan%%, %3Khuchar%%, %3Ong Khan%% wishes to ally with %3Temujin%%! If they unite, it spells our doom. Let us turn the troops %3Ong Khan%% gave us against him, seize power, and rule ourselves!"),
