    ("#030//Senggum", "Vile %3Temujin%%! Seducing my father, stealing my lands! My kingdom, my Khanate, all shattered by %3Temujin%%! I could drink your blood, Temujin! Father, we must flee!"),
    ("#031//Ong Khan", "My son... had we not turned against %3Temujin%%, he would never have done this to us. We reap the bitter seeds we sowed!"),
