    ("#018//Tayang Khan", "Truly? Hmm... Mongols are savage and unyielding. Clashing head-on will bleed us white. They are weary from their march; let us feign retreat to draw them deep into the mountains, then strike when they are exhausted. Tell %3Kuchlug%% we withdraw!"),
