    ("#020//Kuchlug's Contempt", "The Khagan has lost his nerve again! Where could so many Mongols have come from? %3Jamukha%%, %3Torito%%, %3Altan%%, and %3Khuchar%% are all in our camp--where could %3Temujin%% raise such an army? My father grew up in gilded palaces; the mere whisper of foes terrifies him like an old woman!"),
    ("#021//Ulisube", "My Khan, we fear no Mongols! Order the advance!"),
