    ("#033//Tolui", "(Tayang Khan trembles; let me fan his terror!)\nThose are my father's Four Fierce Hounds--%3Jebe%%, %3Subutai%%, %3Qubilai%%, and %3Jelme%%! Their iron wills never falter; they kill without blinking and feel no pain. In battle they feast on human flesh, feared by all as the 'Four Hounds'! O great %3Tayang Khan%%, do you wish to see these hunting dogs tear your flesh?"),
    ("#034//Tayang Khan", "Enough, enough! Steer clear of them, lest we be torn apart! Retreat!"),
    ("#035//Torito", "(Tayang Khan is so cowardly; he cannot be relied upon...)"),
    ("#036//Torito", "Even if we cannot stop them, do not let them take victory cheaply! Dull their edge!"),
    ("#037//Qodu", "Father speaks true wisdom."),
    ("#038//Jelme", "%3Tayang Khan%% retreats again!"),
    ("#039//Temujin", "Until %3Tayang Khan%% is captured and %3Tolui%% is freed, do not slacken! Accelerate the charge!"),
    ("#040//Tayang Khan", "Who is that warrior charging from the rear like a starving eagle, fearless and terrible?!"),
    ("#041//Tolui", "That is my Khan Father, %3Temujin%%! His head is of bronze, his body of forged iron, without a single chink in his armor! He is the supreme leader of Mongolia, leaping forth to rescue me! Take a good look at him!"),
